            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 24,
              "start": 24
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Horn later lost his job after a random drug test revealed tetrahydrocannabinol (THC) in his system; he asserted the THC came from ingesting an over\u2011the\u2011counter product."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f0ea5f7f316e00ac2150526cfc81dc97a3faeb3a5ef26b387754313ff90077c3",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f0ea5f7f316e-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Horn's lost employment derived from a personal injury (ingesting THC), the court reasoned."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background and Question",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
